<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Offline - PAKISTAN FF GUILD</title>
    <style>
        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }
        body {
            font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #0a0a15, #1a1a2e);
            min-height: 100vh;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;
            text-align: center;
            padding: 2rem;
        }
        .offline-container {
            background: rgba(255,255,255,0.1);
            backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
            border-radius: 20px;
            padding: 2rem;
            max-width: 400px;
            border: 1px solid #FF6A00;
        }
        h1 {
            color: #FF6A00;
            font-size: 3rem;
            margin-bottom: 1rem;
        }
        p {
            color: #ccc;
            margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
        }
        button {
            background: #FF6A00;
            border: none;
            padding: 12px 24px;
            border-radius: 30px;
            color: white;
            font-weight: bold;
            cursor: pointer;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="offline-container">
        <h1>📡 Offline</h1>
        <p>You are currently offline. Please check your internet connection and try again.</p>
        <button onclick="location.reload()">Retry ↻</button>
        <p style="margin-top: 1rem; font-size: 0.8rem;">PAKISTAN FF GUILD will work again when you're back online.</p>
    </div>
</body>
</html>